Package: mcmgr
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: games
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10)
Recommends: default-jre-headless | default-jre
Description: command-line manager for Java Edition Minecraft
 mcmgr downloads, installs, launches and verifies vanilla Minecraft
 (Java Edition) without a launcher GUI.  It keeps versions, libraries,
 assets, natives and per-version launch settings under ~/.mcmgr
 (override with MCMGR_HOME or --root), supports offline play with a
 user name and optional UUID override, and can download through the
 BMCLAPI mirror from mainland China.
 .
 A Java runtime (8 or newer, matching the game version) is required to
 actually start the game, not to install files.
